<Essay title="The 2 AM Anxiety Test: Vendor or Trusted Advisor? | Jack P. Flaherty"
  description="When a client's world cracks open, do they call you? Jack P. Flaherty, former Big 4 director, on the difference between a vendor and a trusted advisor."
